# rhwp equation text without the HyhwpEQ face, for why-hwp.
# Base: rhwp 981ce66b4 (v0.9.1) after wasm/patch-rhwp.sh and the patches before this one
# in byte order; apply after rhwp-trackchange3.patch.
# Zero-context diff (apply with git apply --unidiff-zero).
#
# - equation/text_layer_face.rs: a generated TrueType face, "RHWP Equation
#   Text", with one box glyph per code painted with HyhwpEQ and HyhwpEQ's hmtx
#   advance and vertical metrics. Numbers only, no outline or byte of the face.
# - equation/hancom_glyphs.rs, equation/svg_render.rs: the advances, from the
#   glyph table and the structure glyphs.
# - pdf.rs: when the PDF font database has no HyhwpEQ, its glyphs are drawn as
#   paths of the characters they stand for and written once more in the
#   generated face, transparent, so the PDF text holds HyhwpEQ's codes at its
#   advances whatever fonts are installed. Structure glyph hints do the same
#   over their paths. The generated face is never a fallback face.
# - pdf.rs and equation/text_layer_face.rs cover these changes.
diff --git a/src/renderer/equation/hancom_glyphs.rs b/src/renderer/equation/hancom_glyphs.rs
index 7b4be7edd3..5aea4c650f 100644
